OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain are likely this
OL,7,Fevening and tonight, with some heavier
OL,8,Fbursts at times. It will gradually
OL,9,Fturn drier from the north in the early
OL,10,Fhours with some clear spells. However
OL,11,Fmost places will remain cloudy. Winds
OL,12,Feasing.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FA cloudy start on Sunday with
OL,15,Fsome showery outbreaks of rain at
OL,16,Ffirst, but some brighter spells likely
OL,17,Fdeveloping in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
